==========================================================

6.1 No modified version, fork, remake, remaster, sequel, port, or other derivative work based on the Project may be publicly distributed or released without prior written permission from the Community Representative.

6.2 Team Members who wish to develop the Project further within the Community are encouraged to do so collaboratively through the Official Repository.

6.3 Any development, modification, or derivative work based on the Project by current or former Team Members or external parties requires prior written permission from the Community Representative unless expressly permitted by applicable contribution terms.

6.4 Any Team Member who leaves the Community and wishes to contribute further to the Project's development should do so through the Official Repository with the Community's involvement and approval.

6.5 Unauthorized development, distribution, or reuse of the Project may result in enforcement actions under applicable law and platform policies, including platform-based takedown procedures and other copyright enforcement measures where applicable.

